{"id":"b53b63652237d07a","group":"90","path":"90/90-fact-proof-predicate-pr.md","title":"fact-proof-predicate-pr — Proof Predicate is PR","display":"fact-proof-predicate-pr — Proof Predicate is PR","type":"fact","metadata":{"type":"fact","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-fact-proof-predicate-pr","aliases":["90-fact-proof-predicate-pr"],"display":"fact-proof-predicate-pr — Proof Predicate is PR","depends_on":["[[90-df-proof-predicate]]","[[90-df-primitive-recursive]]","[[90-lem-sequence-coding]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"fact"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-fact-proof-predicate-pr"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-fact-proof-predicate-pr</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"fact-proof-predicate-pr — Proof Predicate is PR"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8c071ce52fa72de0\" href=\"?note=8c071ce52fa72de0\" title=\"90-df-proof-predicate\">90-df-proof-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"abc082683aa1de80\" href=\"?note=abc082683aa1de80\" title=\"90-df-primitive-recursive\">90-df-primitive-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1cdf7925a164f89d\" href=\"?note=1cdf7925a164f89d\" title=\"90-lem-sequence-coding\">90-lem-sequence-coding</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>序列码、长度和坐标的原始递归性由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1cdf7925a164f89d\" href=\"?note=1cdf7925a164f89d\" title=\"90-lem-sequence-coding\">90-lem-sequence-coding</a> 给出；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LineOK}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{LineOK}_T\\)</span> 必须是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8c071ce52fa72de0\" href=\"?note=8c071ce52fa72de0\" title=\"90-df-proof-predicate\">90-df-proof-predicate</a> 对同一证明码格式定义的关系。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (effectively axiomatized theory whose proof codes carry primitive-recursively checkable axiom certificates)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LineOK}_T\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}_2\">\\(\\mathrm{LineOK}_T\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}_2\\)</span> (primitive-recursive relation between a proof code and a line position)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProofCode}_T(p,n)\">\\(\\operatorname{ProofCode}_T(p,n)\\)</span> (external proof-code relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8c071ce52fa72de0\" href=\"?note=8c071ce52fa72de0\" title=\"90-df-proof-predicate\">90-df-proof-predicate</a>)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}proof\\text{-}predicate\\text{-}pr}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{LineOK}_T\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}_2\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\operatorname{ProofCode}_T\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}_2.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}proof\\text{-}predicate\\text{-}pr}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{LineOK}_T\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}_2\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\operatorname{ProofCode}_T\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}_2.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Proof\">[Proof]</h2>\n<p>展开 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProofCode}_T(p,n)\">\\(\\operatorname{ProofCode}_T(p,n)\\)</span>，只使用序列合法性、长度大于零、按长度有界的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LineOK}_T(p,i)\">\\(\\mathrm{LineOK}_T(p,i)\\)</span> 全称检查，以及末项与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 的相等检查。序列操作、相等测试和有界积均原始递归，故整个特征函数原始递归。带证书的实际 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LineOK}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{LineOK}_T\\)</span> 由固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_2\">\\(T_2\\)</span> 计算历史检查构成，其原始递归性见所引定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProofCode}_T\">\\(\\operatorname{ProofCode}_T\\)</span> 是原始递归的外部关系；其对象语言表示式是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prf}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Prf}_T\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8c071ce52fa72de0\" href=\"?note=8c071ce52fa72de0\" title=\"90-df-proof-predicate\">90-df-proof-predicate</a>)。</li>\n<li>证明谓词是原始递归关系，而不是“初等递归”这一不同复杂度类的同义词。</li>\n<li>对仅 c.e. 的公理集，证明编码须携带有限枚举证书；否则“这一行是公理”未必原始递归。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Proof","text":"[Proof]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-proof-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"8c071ce52fa72de0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-proof-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"abc082683aa1de80","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-primitive-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-lem-sequence-coding","status":"resolved","id":"1cdf7925a164f89d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-lem-sequence-coding]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-lem-sequence-coding","status":"resolved","id":"1cdf7925a164f89d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"序列码、长度和坐标的原始递归性由 [[90-lem-sequence-coding]] 给出；$\\mathrm{LineOK}_T$ 必须是 [[90-df-proof-predicate]] 对同一证明码格式定义的关系。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-proof-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"8c071ce52fa72de0","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"序列码、长度和坐标的原始递归性由 [[90-lem-sequence-coding]] 给出；$\\mathrm{LineOK}_T$ 必须是 [[90-df-proof-predicate]] 对同一证明码格式定义的关系。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-proof-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"8c071ce52fa72de0","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ProofCode}_T(p,n)$ (external proof-code relation, see [[90-df-proof-predicate]])","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-proof-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"8c071ce52fa72de0","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ProofCode}_T$ 是原始递归的外部关系；其对象语言表示式是 $\\mathrm{Prf}_T$ (see [[90-df-proof-predicate]])。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{LineOK}_T","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LineOK}_T\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ProofCode}_T(p,n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}proof\\text{-}predicate\\text{-}pr}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{LineOK}_T\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}_2\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\operatorname{ProofCode}_T\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}_2.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ProofCode}_T(p,n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LineOK}_T(p,i)","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LineOK}_T","display":false},{"tex":"T_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ProofCode}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prf}_T","display":false}],"bytes":1899,"backlinks":[{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-151","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-fact-diagonal-function-recursive.md]]\n[[90-fact-godel-number-effective.md]]\n[[90-fact-normal-system-undecidable.md]]\n[[90-fact-numeral-injective.md]]\n[[90-fact-paradox-equivalence.md]]\n[[90-fact-proof-predicate-pr.md]]\n[[90-fact-representation-implies-numeralwise.md]]"}],"outgoing":["8c071ce52fa72de0","abc082683aa1de80","1cdf7925a164f89d"]}